  "prefLabel": "He-W 547.02 Recipient Eligibility",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 547.02 Recipient Eligibility. Recipients who are within 60 days postpartum shall be eligible for home visit services.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading He-W 500); ss by #6018, eff 4-1-95, EXPIRED: 4-1-03\n\nNew. #8446, eff 10-7-05; ss by #10428, eff 10-7-13; ss by #14334, eff 8-1-25, EXPIRES: 8-1-35",
